{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall bind them for a sign upon your hand.</b> Self-evident." "<b>As frontlets.</b> This word has no cognate in Scripture. The deniers say it is derived from הטף אל דרום, but this is impossible, for the root of נטף is נטף, whereas this lacks a nun and has a doubled tet."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:34.047002012Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}